  "intro": "JROC implements get/set/has/deleteProperty/ownKeys, descriptor, prototype, extensibility, apply, construct, and revocation proxy operations. Trap invocation uses centralized callable dispatch across generated and adapted callables. Proxy support remains incomplete for some descriptor-heavy, seal/freeze, and full invariant cases."
